        "url": "https://www.kern-ux.de/komponenten/kopfzeile#kurzbeschreibung",
        "summary": {
          "en": "The Kopfzeile marks digital presences of public administration, such as authorities, online services and service portals."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "container-kopfzeile",
        "heading": "Container Kopfzeile",
        "url": "https://www.kern-ux.de/komponenten/kopfzeile#container-kopfzeile",
        "summary": {
          "en": "Shows the markup for the container variant, where the bar spans the full browser width and the content aligns with the page container."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fluid-kopfzeile",
